er, and outdoor mount.\\n                <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\"flex items-start gap-space-xs p-2 rounded bg-surface-container-low\\">\\n<span class=\\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\\">schedule<\\/span>\\n<div class=\\"text-body-sm text-on-surface\\">\\n<strong>Preventive Maintenance Contracts (PMS):<\\/strong> Quarterly chemical foam coil cleanings and thermodynamic inspection for commercial complexes.\\n                <\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\"pt-space-sm flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-space-sm\\">\\n<span class=\\"font-label-code text-label-sm text-on-surface-variant\\">Free On-Site Survey Across North Luzon<\\/span>\\n<a class=\\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 px-4 py-2 rounded bg-primary text-on-primary font-title-md text-body-md font-semibold hover:bg-primary-container transition-colors\\" href=\\"#rfq-estimator\\">\\n<span>Book Aircon Survey<\\/span>\\n<span class=\\"material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]\\">chevron_right<\\/span>\\n<\\/a>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<div class=\\"bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-lg rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between space-y-space-md\\"><h3>Mitsubishi Electric elevator and escalator equipment<\\/h3><p>Explore elevators for passengers, hospitals, homes and freight, along with straight-line and spiral escalators, moving walks, and building controls.<\\/p><a class=\\"canriv-button\\" href=\\"%%CANRIV:vertical-transport-url%%\\">View Mitsubishi Electric equipment<\\/a><\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/section><\\/div>"},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"ca567fc","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"_title":"Featured Machinery & Cooling Units","content_width":"full","padding":{"unit":"px","top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0,"isLinked":true}},"elements":[{"id":"bd69d57","elType":"widget","widgetType":"html","isInner":false,"settings":{"_title":"Featured Machinery & Cooling Units","html":"%%CANRIV:vertical-transport-summary%%"},